WEBVTT

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:06.770
"I... love you."

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:13.290
Brother, what is "love," in this sentence?

00:00:14.890 --> 00:00:17.200
Ferris, you don't know what love is?

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:25.460
I'm sure that what I feel for you, Ferris, is love.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:30.620
You do, Brother? You love me?

00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:36.830
Of course I do. I'm certain that Father, Mother, and Iris all love you.

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:41.270
Is training hard for you?

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:46.160
I see. You impress me, Ferris.

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:49.780
Am I being complimented?

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:52.720
No, you're being loved.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:34.580
You're always such a disappointment.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:37.480
Our blood runs through your veins.

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:41.560
So why can't you stop such a simple sword blow?

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:43.180
I'm getting up now.

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:49.340
How unseemly.

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:54.970
I'm so embarrassed to have given birth to such a failure.

00:02:56.140 --> 00:02:59.740
I still have high hopes, though.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:04.910
At the very least, she holds the blood of us siblings,

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:08.000
who have been hailed as geniuses since House Eris's beginning.

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:09.750
Siblings?

00:03:10.110 --> 00:03:15.640
If we could bring the blood of your father to House Eris once more...

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:18.130
...it is certainly a possibility.

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:22.050
Mother, just what are you...

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:24.470
Ah, no more of this foolishness.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:26.390
If you are doomed to failure,

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:29.480
at least be a proper girl for House Eris.

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:42.870
Father...

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:54.540
Why, you...

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:03.730
My dear younger sister is not meant to be soiled by your filthy hands.

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:05.050
Brother...

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:06.450
I see.

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:09.810
So you, too, are a failure.

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:17.520
There is no need for those unsuited for House Eris to live.

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:35.460
You were bragging about being a genius with your level of power?

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:37.960
W-What the hell...?

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:39.420
First comes destruction. Then rebirth.

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:40.880
What are you...

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:44.080
Destruction. Rebirth. Destruction. Rebirth.

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:48.640
You... Don't tell me you're using...

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:59.690
Come, you have nothing left to fear. It's all over.

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:05.180
From now on, I will protect you.

00:05:22.220 --> 00:05:25.520
Ferris is at that man's place again today?

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:32.810
This is no time to sleep!

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:36.300
We have an emergency. You have two seconds to make preparations.

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.200
One. Two.

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:40.230
Okay, let's go.

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:42.690
What the hell are you doing this early?

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:44.910
I told you, it's an emergency.

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:46.780
While we've been away from Roland,

00:05:46.780 --> 00:05:49.270
the <i>dango</i> power relationships have been practically rewritten!

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:54.260
Right now in Roland, there's a rush of new emergent dumpling stalls!

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:57.140
Unknown dumplings await us!

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:59.000
Doesn't it make your heart sing?

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:01.500
Fine, just let me sleep a little longer!

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.840
Ryner, today I'll save...

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:06.090
What are you doing?!

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.570
I-It couldn't be...

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:11.520
C'mon, Ryner!

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:14.850
Fine. Just let me sleep a little longer, honey.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:17.220
You're filthy, Ryner!

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:19.440
Hey, I think you've got the wrong idea.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:23.380
I tried to resist at first, you know.

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:26.170
But against Ryner, the peerless perversion master...

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:28.680
Why are you adding fuel to the fire?!

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:30.320
What I seek is thunder.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:31.700
You...

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.590
Well, I'm off first.

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:33.810
Hey...

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:35.580
You cheater!
Hey...

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:36.450
You cheater!

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:45.460
The weather today is perfect for dumplings.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:48.920
You... filthy, filthy, filthy man!

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:00.520
You seem to rather like this place.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:04.720
Yeah. I don't get my peaceful sleep interrupted by dumpling girls here,

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:08.640
or get my bed blown up by lightning girls.

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:12.060
I have trouble bringing myself to push work on you like this, but...

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:14.110
Then don't.

00:07:14.590 --> 00:07:18.450
I'd like you and Ferris to come with me to Estabul.

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:21.500
Can't hear you. Nope. Can't hear a thing.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:29.010
Whatever the case, I need an escort. It's not secure outside of Roland.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:32.010
You could get tons of others to be an escort.

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:36.810
No, you two are the ones I trust the most.

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:42.090
Of course, if you don't do as I say,

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:47.680
I'll wield my influence as a king to the point that you'll do something you hate.

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:50.890
You just blurted out a huge threat.

00:07:50.890 --> 00:07:56.380
Oh, also, about the Alpha Stigma child in the report you sent.

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:58.220
We placed him in the care of House Eris.

00:07:58.220 --> 00:08:01.500
House Eris? That's Ferris's home, isn't it?

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:06.320
Yes. It's a family of the sword, which has traditionally protected the king of Roland.

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:08.300
He should be safe there, don't you think?

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:09.250
Yeah, he should.

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:10.960
How would you like to visit him?

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:13.030
Or would you like to assist me with my job...

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:14.720
Oh, yeah!

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:17.470
I had some business with Arua!

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:19.720
So on that note, see ya.

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:25.480
Now then, better get to work.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:30.750
I figured I'd get my fill of afternoon naps once I got back to Roland. Oh, well.

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:47.330
This is what you asked for, right?

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:50.260
Thank you very much, Sir Miller.

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:52.980
It seems to be a rather valuable book.

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:56.130
Only a small number of copies exist across the whole continent.

00:08:56.130 --> 00:09:01.140
Yes. To understand the full substance of my mission, I wanted to give it a read.

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:09.150
Did you find something?

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:14.740
No. It just has so many interesting points of reference, I got engrossed in reading it.

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:16.750
I'll use this with great care.

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:31.490
When they go out of control, they always... die"?

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:40.850
"There is not a single historic exception to this."

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:46.540
Is that really true?

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:53.320
Back then, Ryner definitely went out of control.

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:58.030
But he came back from it without dying.

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:02.030
Is this all I can learn here?

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:08.420
Apparently, there's still a lot of folklore in Gastark about the Magic Eyes.

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:17.120
Guess I'll have to go.

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:27.840
This is, uh... something else.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:35.820
A warm welcome to you, Sir Ryner Lute.

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:38.650
Sir Arua and Lady Kuku await.

00:10:39.590 --> 00:10:42.480
Is that right? So those two have been doing well here?

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:44.320
Indeed, quite so.

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:46.740
They've been bouncing off the walls since this morning,

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:48.900
when they heard you were coming today.

00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:53.630
What's that?

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:56.170
The dojo, sir.

00:10:56.170 --> 00:11:01.470
Though the interior is treated as the room of Sir Lucile, head of House Eris.

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.780
Is that Ferris's old man?

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:07.350
No, he is Lady Ferris's elder brother.

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:08.450
And their parents?

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:10.070
Unfortunately...

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:11.720
I see.

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:15.060
So Ferris was freed at that point.

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:21.490
One glimpse of that incredible talent makes it easy to tell.

00:11:22.020 --> 00:11:24.730
She was abused a lot, wasn't she?

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:30.620
Tell me. How old did she get before it stopped?

00:11:32.800 --> 00:11:39.130
When Lady Ferris turned fourteen, the prior house head passed away.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.910
Fourteen years, huh?

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:46.180
That's a long time.

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:47.990
Quite so.

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:54.060
But right now, Lady Ferris has people like you and Lord Astal at her side.

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:55.900
Watch out!

00:11:57.630 --> 00:12:00.730
Kroselli, you mustn't let this wild beast get close to you!

00:12:00.730 --> 00:12:04.860
If he touches you even a little, he'll turn you pregnant!

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:06.480
Ow, ow, ow...

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:09.010
Mister Ryner!

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:11.910
All right! Let's beat that wild beast and capture him!

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:13.620
Arua, flank him to the left!

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.000
Okay, sister Iris!

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:20.590
She's got you totally tamed, doesn't she, Arua—

00:12:23.190 --> 00:12:24.550
Miss Ferris!

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:28.100
What are you doing raising a fuss in someone else's house?

00:12:30.900 --> 00:12:34.640
My head isn't your sandbag, okay?

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.490
Kuku, this one's delicious, too!

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:40.480
Aww, Arua!

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:44.150
Sister, are you full already?

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:48.590
None of them are bad, but the depth of their taste...

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:52.160
Perhaps the full dumpling experience can't be achieved in just one day.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:55.160
But the dumplings here had a new taste...

00:13:17.590 --> 00:13:18.770
Mister Ryner?

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:24.630
What's the matter, Mister Ryner?

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:26.520
Oh, uh, nothing.

00:13:29.800 --> 00:13:32.200
I've got a little favor to ask.

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:35.630
Could you take a look at that dojo over there with your Alpha Stigma?

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:39.190
Sure, but is this some kind of training?

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:41.010
Well, maybe.

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:44.520
Either way, if it gets dangerous, close your eyes immediately. Got it?

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:45.260
Yes, sir.

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:53.860
Okay, so what do I do now?

00:13:53.860 --> 00:13:57.180
You really don't see anything?

00:13:57.180 --> 00:13:58.770
I see the dojo clearly.

00:14:02.080 --> 00:14:05.030
Okay, thanks. That's enough.

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:14.490
So he wants us to escort him all the way to Estabul.

00:14:15.300 --> 00:14:16.510
So basically you're saying

00:14:16.510 --> 00:14:22.630
that we're being worked to the bone by that diabolical disregarder of labor standards, King Sion Astal?

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:25.780
All right, let's resume our search for Hero Relics.

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:29.880
Yeah. For once, we're in agreement. So when do we set out?

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:31.400
Tomorrow morning.

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:33.800
The meeting point will be in front of the Wynnit dumpling shop.

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:36.390
To stock up for the road, huh?

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:40.190
Yes. We'll split seven backpacks' worth between us.

00:14:40.190 --> 00:14:42.400
Seven backpacks' worth?

00:14:45.830 --> 00:14:52.270
<i>But right now, Lady Ferris has people like you and Lord Astal at her side.</i>

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:57.250
Okay, fine. I'll carry all seven.

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:02.630
You must be growing to understand the way of the dumpling!

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:06.090
Then I had best prepare fourteen backpacks without delay!

00:15:06.650 --> 00:15:08.640
Why did she double them?!

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:25.570
Ferris and Arua are probably both sound asleep by now.

00:15:25.570 --> 00:15:28.320
Even though they have someone so dangerous right at their side.

00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:57.140
You're Ferris's brother?

00:15:57.530 --> 00:16:01.520
That's correct, Lucile Eris. Ryner Lute, I presume?

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:07.520
Ferris has been getting along well with you.

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:11.030
I've been hoping to meet with you alone like this for a long time.

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:19.030
My, you didn't even flinch.

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:23.040
Your strength is just about on par with Ferris's, I think.

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:27.170
Nah. If she got serious, I'd be dead a hundred times over.

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:32.050
Still, I'm glad Ferris's partner is you.

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:35.670
You're going to Estabul as Sion's escort after this, aren't you?

00:16:35.670 --> 00:16:38.180
Is it safe to trust both of them to you?

00:16:38.690 --> 00:16:41.110
That part's fine, but, y'know...

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:43.560
...isn't protecting the king your job?

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:48.570
Yet Sion asked me and Ferris to escort him.

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:50.640
Doesn't it sound strange to you?

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:54.790
Almost like you can only protect the king inside Roland itself.

00:16:56.040 --> 00:17:00.830
Is there some reason you can't leave Roland? For example...

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:05.460
...a curse with that kind of binding.

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:09.870
A curse of binding? You say some amusing things.

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:11.460
What makes you think that?

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:14.030
I don't think that. I see it.

00:17:14.030 --> 00:17:16.590
Or rather, maybe I should say I can't see it?

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:20.930
Your figure doesn't show up at all in my Alpha Stigma.

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:23.350
What the hell are you?

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:25.660
Just as you're already aware.

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:27.230
I am Ferris's elder brother, and...

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:29.230
Don't even try to say that!

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:31.540
Ferris is human. She's not like you!

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:32.850
What the hell are...?

00:17:40.610 --> 00:17:41.780
Y-You...

00:17:42.390 --> 00:17:44.850
Ferris isn't a monster?

00:17:45.720 --> 00:17:48.950
Yes, indeed. You understand her well.

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:53.750
Ferris is human. Unlike me, and you.

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:58.970
So I'd like for you to avoid getting the wrong idea.

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:01.290
She will not be yours.

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:05.020
Neither my blood nor your blood will mingle with hers.

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:08.390
I will not allow it.

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:14.270
What are you getting at?

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:19.570
What manner of unfulfillable dreams has such a hideous monster seen?

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:21.980
You should know as much already.

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:27.270
You can't grasp anything with those blood-stained monster's hands of yours.

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:29.690
You can't reach anywhere.

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:34.640
That is why I am at ease with entrusting my younger sister to you.

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:38.670
You can't touch my sister. You can't touch anyone.

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:41.680
Not you, when you hold no value in being alive.

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:49.750
I don't hate you.

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:52.900
Come, lift your face.

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:56.730
And do take care of Ferris.

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:05.580
Ah, Ryner!

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:09.180
Where did you go, this late at night?

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:11.590
What's wrong? You look a little green.

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:13.700
It's nothing, really.

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:15.850
So what are you here for, anyway?

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:18.220
Well, um...

00:19:19.480 --> 00:19:20.890
Here!

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:24.590
Tomorrow, everyone in the squadron is holding a birthday party for me.

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:27.070
So I was hoping you could come, Ryner.

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:27.850
Tomorrow?

00:19:27.850 --> 00:19:31.850
Tomorrow morning. The meeting point will be in front of the Wynnit dumpling shop.

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:37.790
And Luke said he's going to do all the cooking!

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:41.240
Luke made those written invitations, too. And, see...

00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:44.600
Wait, hold on. Your birthday?

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:48.160
Y-Yeah. I don't know my real birthday.

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:52.080
But, see, Luke and the others suggested it.

00:19:52.080 --> 00:19:54.550
They said we could take the day our squadron was first formed,

00:19:54.550 --> 00:19:56.420
and make it my birthday!

00:19:58.670 --> 00:20:01.160
Ryner, make sure to come tomorrow, okay?

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:07.770
What to do...

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:10.370
Still, one day shouldn't be too bad.

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:13.280
I could say something like, "Let's wait until after we dispose of Sion."

00:20:13.280 --> 00:20:15.020
Ferris would be fine with that.

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:27.990
My deepest apologies, Captain Milk.

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:31.750
If that taboo breaker goes out of control,

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:36.970
you would have to take his life yourself, the life you treasure so dearly.

00:20:41.430 --> 00:20:42.260
So...

00:20:43.140 --> 00:20:45.590
This is the best way to handle it.

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:48.720
I gave it to him!

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:53.100
If Ryner comes, I know it'll be the best birthday ever!

00:21:09.670 --> 00:21:14.620
"If the Alpha Stigma bearer, Ryner Lute, goes out of control outside the country,

00:21:14.970 --> 00:21:19.440
or behaves in a manner implying treason against Roland,

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:21.210
eliminate him immediately."

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:25.720
Signed and sealed by His Majesty, Sion Astal, huh?

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:31.590
<i>What manner of unfulfillable dreams has such a hideous monster seen?</i>

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:34.810
I see.

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:41.520
I guess he's right.

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:45.760
He must be right.

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:23.880
<i>It's really something I've known for a long, long time.</i>

00:23:23.880 --> 00:23:27.370
<i>That as long as I'm around, things will suck all around me.</i>

00:23:27.370 --> 00:23:30.110
<i>Hey, we all deal with stuff that sucks, okay?</i>

00:23:30.110 --> 00:23:32.650
<i>So just leave me alone.</i>

00:23:32.650 --> 00:23:33.910
<i>This sucks.</i>
